{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Love Begins with Goodbye</i>, an interactive romance game set in Norway, blending Chinese and Norwegian cultures! In this game, you will step into the shoes of a Chinese exchange student embarking on a six-month journey in Norway. You will live with three girls, each with distinct personalities, in a foreign land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Characters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Luo Xue\u2019er, an exchange student from China like you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheerful yet somewhat impulsive, she always brings you surprises and laughter. Could she be the true love of your life, sharing the same cultural background?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/56227d6bf131d0dc7e0791f74f2ad754.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/56227d6bf131d0dc7e0791f74f2ad754.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/56227d6bf131d0dc7e0791f74f2ad754.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Enora, a girl who is learning Chinese and plans to study in Beijing next year:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rational and composed, she holds back when it comes to emotions. But will she open up as you get closer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/b5864fae394e490624785899e6d35e89.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/b5864fae394e490624785899e6d35e89.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/b5864fae394e490624785899e6d35e89.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Leah\uff0cyour mysterious and elegant landlady:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a captivating smile, she seems to hide a secret. Will you uncover the mystery behind her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f7d2b826c91e2b962894850ee30c0ff7.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f7d2b826c91e2b962894850ee30c0ff7.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f7d2b826c91e2b962894850ee30c0ff7.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Yu Yingluo, your childhood friend:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She didn\u2019t study abroad, but could there still be a chance for you two to develop a relationship?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/92964d243d40eb057ceaa85c704541ed.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/92964d243d40eb057ceaa85c704541ed.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/92964d243d40eb057ceaa85c704541ed.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Multiple Storylines: Every choice you make will influence the course of the story. The characters, dialogues, and events you encounter will change based on your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Deep Character Development: Each character has a complete storyline, allowing you to experience a love story through different cultural perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Set against the backdrop of Norway: Immerse yourself in the exotic atmosphere and feel the strong sense of novelty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0HD Graphics and Beautiful Original Soundtrack: Offering an immersive gaming experience with stunning visuals and enchanting music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Multiple Endings: Different choices lead to different endings\u2014deciding who you\u2019ll end up with and what kind of relationship you\u2019ll develop is all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0We look forward to you embarking on this wonderful journey of love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f063f0981cd81b40e6da541c9e8b1e6b.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f063f0981cd81b40e6da541c9e8b1e6b.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f063f0981cd81b40e6da541c9e8b1e6b.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Word from the Author:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, I\u2019m Lao Wang, a Chinese person living in Norway. For this game, I designed a theme for each character: The Miracle of Snow, The Price of Freedom, The Witch\u2019s Lie, and The Secret You Can\u2019t Tell. My concept for the game is that while the gameplay is simple, each character offers a completely different experience. The inclusion of foreign beauties isn\u2019t the selling point of the game; the core attraction of this type of game has always been the storyline. This is my strength, which is why I wrote, directed, and edited this game myself. I hope you enjoy this game and have a happy time playing it. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brief Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Love Post-Parting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/e48ff3006d448a85f9389dd7981da0aca52e9e17.jpg"},{"name":"Caring You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/a9d1a675e09f0f14186c109f0fc82a174d4f7a0e.jpg"},{"name":"Milk Over Wine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/4b13f9d2d07f31162d746210fc08d47068a8219c.jpg"},{"name":"Rent-Free Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/4307e6568948aa684cb685972a42abd1349c020f.jpg"},{"name":"Laiya's Lunch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/a14a4b82b5c3699350a8b2d8681b16a823d01c30.jpg"},{"name":"Venison Dish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/2ffeb73bfa49153438d4ba95bb704e0bfee8262e.jpg"},{"name":"Ice Cream Pier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/c9c8211de12c6605dd86055a149d8dfb7c0d9322.jpg"},{"name":"Cursed Witch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/e59869d43c3c8db3a286becd40bffe6e0a2bdddc.jpg"},{"name":"Working Soul, Working Folks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/c4e5bfc425dd83038f78b99270cdb403336dadf6.jpg"},{"name":"\"Perfect Match\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652650/a7c70df9a0d1430b26d3051c71282b1b3385f2ee.jpg"}],"total":38},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652650?t=1761941606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652650?t=1761941606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/3d90b0feac889f167e242006b5ab65cb4acfec69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761941606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/3d90b0feac889f167e242006b5ab65cb4acfec69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761941606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Certain video sequences and dialogues in the game may contain elements such as \u200b\u200b\"revealing clothing,\" \"sexual innuendo,\" \"alcohol consumption,\" and \"adult-oriented environments\"\u200b\u200b (e.g., bars, arcades). This content may not be suitable for all ages."},"demos":[{"appid":3667780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Love Begins with Goodbye</i>, an interactive romance game set in Norway, blending Chinese and Norwegian cultures! In this game, you will step into the shoes of a Chinese exchange student embarking on a six-month journey in Norway. You will live with three girls, each with distinct personalities, in a foreign land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Characters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Luo Xue\u2019er, an exchange student from China like you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheerful yet somewhat impulsive, she always brings you surprises and laughter. Could she be the true love of your life, sharing the same cultural background?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/56227d6bf131d0dc7e0791f74f2ad754.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/56227d6bf131d0dc7e0791f74f2ad754.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/56227d6bf131d0dc7e0791f74f2ad754.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Enora, a girl who is learning Chinese and plans to study in Beijing next year:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rational and composed, she holds back when it comes to emotions. But will she open up as you get closer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/b5864fae394e490624785899e6d35e89.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/b5864fae394e490624785899e6d35e89.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/b5864fae394e490624785899e6d35e89.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Leah\uff0cyour mysterious and elegant landlady:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a captivating smile, she seems to hide a secret. Will you uncover the mystery behind her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f7d2b826c91e2b962894850ee30c0ff7.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f7d2b826c91e2b962894850ee30c0ff7.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f7d2b826c91e2b962894850ee30c0ff7.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Yu Yingluo, your childhood friend:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She didn\u2019t study abroad, but could there still be a chance for you two to develop a relationship?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/92964d243d40eb057ceaa85c704541ed.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/92964d243d40eb057ceaa85c704541ed.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/92964d243d40eb057ceaa85c704541ed.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Multiple Storylines: Every choice you make will influence the course of the story. The characters, dialogues, and events you encounter will change based on your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Deep Character Development: Each character has a complete storyline, allowing you to experience a love story through different cultural perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Set against the backdrop of Norway: Immerse yourself in the exotic atmosphere and feel the strong sense of novelty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0HD Graphics and Beautiful Original Soundtrack: Offering an immersive gaming experience with stunning visuals and enchanting music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2022\u00a0Multiple Endings: Different choices lead to different endings\u2014deciding who you\u2019ll end up with and what kind of relationship you\u2019ll develop is all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0We look forward to you embarking on this wonderful journey of love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f063f0981cd81b40e6da541c9e8b1e6b.poster.avif?t=1761941606\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f063f0981cd81b40e6da541c9e8b1e6b.webm?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/extras/f063f0981cd81b40e6da541c9e8b1e6b.mp4?t=1761941606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Word from the Author:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, I\u2019m Lao Wang, a Chinese person living in Norway. For this game, I designed a theme for each character: The Miracle of Snow, The Price of Freedom, The Witch\u2019s Lie, and The Secret You Can\u2019t Tell. My concept for the game is that while the gameplay is simple, each character offers a completely different experience. The inclusion of foreign beauties isn\u2019t the selling point of the game; the core attraction of this type of game has always been the storyline. This is my strength, which is why I wrote, directed, and edited this game myself. I hope you enjoy this game and have a happy time playing it. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brief Description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u5927\u738b\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4","\u6846\u55d2\u7f51\u7edc"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652650/0d69307cba333c04608aa7f162a78ca78b886f34/header.jpg?t=1761941606","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3652650/1991057179/a7baf41e923b72c646500e8bf6e49e7cea0055b0/1750414694/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747730777","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3652650/1991057179/a7baf41e923b72c646500e8bf6e49e7cea0055b0/1750414694/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747730777","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3652650/1991057179/a7baf41e923b72c646500e8bf6e49e7cea0055b0/1750414694/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747730777","id":257142065,"name":"\u604b\u7231\u4ece\u79bb\u522b\u5f00\u59cb","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142065/ab2d84de029ca4e37bc27d8dfa9f7edaf7179c4e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747730777"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3652650/865834/b552f35819c5f4bbf423209fadc2a762091d81d4/1750414683/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744701698","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3652650/865834/b552f35819c5f4bbf423209fa